          {
            "id": 2758950,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Today, we're pleased to have on the show Alice Bussell from the Dolphin Conservation Trust. Tell us about the trust, Alice.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2758951,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Today, we're pleased to have on the show Alice Bussell from the Dolphin Conservation Trust.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 74.615,
                  "from": 69.255,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2758967,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Tell us about the trust, Alice.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 76.695,
                  "from": 74.695,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2758974,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Well, obviously, its purpose is to protect dolphins in seas all around the world. It tries to raise people's awareness of the problems these marine creatures are suffering because of pollution and other threats. It started ten years ago, and it's one of the fastest growing animal charities in the country, although it's still fairly small compared with the big players in animal protection. We're particularly proud of the work we do in education. Last year, we visited a huge number of schools in different parts of the country, going round to talk to children and young people aged from five to 18.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2758975,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, obviously, its purpose is to protect dolphins in seas all around the world.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 82.134995,
                  "from": 76.935,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2758990,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It tries to raise people's awareness of the problems these marine creatures are suffering because of pollution and other threats.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 89.89,
                  "from": 82.85,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759011,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It started ten years ago, and it's one of the fastest growing animal charities in the country, although it's still fairly small compared with the big players in animal protection.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 100.585,
                  "from": 90.29,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759042,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We're particularly proud of the work we do in education.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 104.505005,
                  "from": 101.145004,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759053,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Last year, we visited a huge number of schools in different parts of the country, going round to talk to children and young people aged from five to 18.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 115.049995,
                  "from": 104.985,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2759083,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "In fact, about 35% of our members are children. The charity uses its money to support campaigns, for example, for changes in fishing policy and so forth. It hopes soon to be able to employ its first full time biologist with dolphin expertise to monitor populations. Of course, many people give their services on a voluntary basis, and we now have volunteers working in observation, office work, and other things. I should also tell you about the award we won from the charity commission last year for our work in education.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2759084,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "In fact, about 35% of our members are children.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 119.21,
                  "from": 115.69,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759094,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The charity uses its money to support campaigns, for example, for changes in fishing policy and so forth.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 127.495,
                  "from": 119.21,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759113,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It hopes soon to be able to employ its first full time biologist with dolphin expertise to monitor populations.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 135.335,
                  "from": 127.495,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759133,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Of course, many people give their services on a voluntary basis, and we now have volunteers working in observation, office work, and other things.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 145.44,
                  "from": 135.815,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759158,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I should also tell you about the award we won from the charity commission last year for our work in education.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 152.48,
                  "from": 146.16,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2759180,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Although it's not meant an enormous amount of money for us, it has made our activities even more widely publicized and understood. In the long term, it may not bring in extra members, but we're hoping it'll have this effect.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2759181,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Although it's not meant an enormous amount of money for us, it has made our activities even more widely publicized and understood.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 160.315,
                  "from": 153.115,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759204,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "In the long term, it may not bring in extra members, but we're hoping it'll have this effect.",
