            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2759223,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Is it possible to see dolphins in UK waters?",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2759224,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Is it possible to see dolphins in UK waters?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 170.23,
                  "from": 166.70999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2759234,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Yes. In several locations. And we have a big project in the East Part Of Scotland. This has long been a haven for dolphins because it has very little shipping. However, that may be about to change soon because oil companies want to increase exploration there.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2759235,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Yes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 171.03,
                  "from": 170.31,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759237,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "In several locations.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 172.55,
                  "from": 171.03,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759241,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And we have a big project in the East Part Of Scotland.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 176.23,
                  "from": 173.11,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759254,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This has long been a haven for dolphins because it has very little shipping.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 180.31,
                  "from": 176.54999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759269,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "However, that may be about to change soon because oil companies want to increase exploration there.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 187.20499,
                  "from": 181.045,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2759286,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "We're campaigning against this because although there'll be little pollution from oil, exploration creates a lot of underwater noise. It means the dolphins can't rest and socialize. This is how I became interested in dolphin conservation in the first place. I had never seen one, and I hadn't been particularly interested in them at school. Then I came across this story about a family of dolphins who had to leave their home in the Moray Firth because of the oil companies and about a child who campaigned to save them.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2759287,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We're campaigning against this because although there'll be little pollution from oil, exploration creates a lot of underwater noise.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 195.685,
                  "from": 187.20499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759307,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It means the dolphins can't rest and socialize.",
                "meta": {
