          },
          {
            "id": 2759421,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "I'm sure our listeners will want to find out what they can do to help. You mentioned the adopt a dolphin scheme. Can you tell us about that?",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2759422,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I'm sure our listeners will want to find out what they can do to help.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 269.025,
                  "from": 265.50497,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759438,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You mentioned the adopt a dolphin scheme.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 272.38498,
                  "from": 269.425,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759446,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Can you tell us about that?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 274.06497,
                  "from": 272.465,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2759453,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Of course. People can choose one of our dolphins to sponsor. They receive a picture of it and news updates. I'd like to tell you about four which are currently being adopted by our members, Moondancer, Echo, Kiwi, and Samson. Unfortunately, Echo is being rather elusive this year and hasn't yet been sighted by our observers, but we remain optimistic that he'll be out there soon.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2759454,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Of course.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 274.945,
                  "from": 274.06497,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759457,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "People can choose one of our dolphins to sponsor.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 277.985,
                  "from": 275.26498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759467,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They receive a picture of it and news updates.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 281.57,
                  "from": 278.37,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759477,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I'd like to tell you about four which are currently being adopted by our members, Moondancer, Echo, Kiwi, and Samson.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 290.44998,
                  "from": 281.97,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2759498,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Unfortunately, Echo is being rather elusive this year and hasn't yet been sighted by our observers, but we remain optimistic that he'll be out there soon.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 300.615,
                  "from": 291.415,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2759525,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "All the others have been out in force. Sampson and Moondancer are often photographed together, but it's Kiwi who's our real character as she seems to love coming up close for the cameras, and we've captured her on film hundreds of times. They all have their own personalities. Moondancer is very elegant and curves out and into the water very smoothly, whereas Sampson has a lot of energy. He's always leaping out of the water with great vigor.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2759526,
                "level": 2,
